  "_comment": [
    "MIRROR, not original. The manifest contract is declared by Core in",
    "system/contracts/manifest-contract.yaml and enforced by Core itself.",
    "",
    "v8 publishes module_concept_edges \u2014 the Module x Concept crossing as",
    "{module_id, concept_id, evidence} rows (ADR-015). Every edge carries the",
    "explicit authored tag that licenses it; no concept is inferred. It also",
    "adds the module_to_concepts / concept_to_modules indexes and repairs",
    "unit_to_concepts / concept_to_units, which had shipped empty since v2.",
    "",
    "The UI fails closed unless both version and schema hash match the",
    "producer lock. This lock must move in the same release as the producer",
    "contract."
